# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit a real key.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WARNING: THIS KEY SHIPS TO THE BROWSER.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the built JavaScript, so this JWT is readable
# by anyone who opens devtools on the deployed site. They can upload to the Pinata account it
# belongs to, and burn its quota.
#
# This is a deliberate, informed tradeoff to unblock the Sepolia demo, and it is only acceptable
# because nothing here has real value yet.
#
# BEFORE MAINNET: move uploads behind a server that holds the key (a small proxy endpoint, or
# Pinata's signed one-time upload URLs), and delete this variable.
#
# Until then: use a key on a throwaway account, scoped to pinFileToIPFS only, and rotate it when
# the demo ends.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_PINATA_JWT=
